title: Surface underway seawater and marine boundary layer observations of partial
  pressure of carbon dioxide (pCO2), water temperature, salinity and other parameters
  made during the M/V Seaspan Royal cruises in the coastal waters of British Columbia,
  Canada from 2022-07-01 to 2022-12-20
